Grep confirms NO config-file mapping for the per-branch override (only the base key is mapped): `config/fiscal.php:31  'audit_secret' => env('FISCAL_AUDIT_SECRET', '')` — and the per-branch var appears ONLY as a doc comment `config/fiscal.php:28` + the raw env() at `AuditLogService.php:273`. `grep -rn FISCAL_AUDIT_SECRET_BRANCH config/ app/Services/Fiscal/` returns only the comment and the env() line. This is the exact historical bug class flagged in CLAUDE.md §8 ('historical: AuditLogService env() read'); the BASE secret was moved to config but the per-branch override was left on raw env().
